# The Haxe guest: compiled to JS, run on top of the wgrender wasm host.
#
# -cp ../simple/src is not used: the shared wgr.Wgr layer lives in src/wgr/Wgr.hx
# here while the target guards are being proven out. See README.
-cp src
-lib wgrender-hx
--main Particles
--js out/web/particles.js

-D js-es=6
-dce full
-D analyzer-optimize
